OL,3,GNEWSAM1 reopens after lorry overturned
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe M1 in Leicestershire has reopened
OL,6,Fafter a lorry overturned on to the
OL,7,Fcentral reservation barrier.
OL,9,FAt about 05:30 BST on Friday, National
OL,10,FHighways said the motorway was shut in
OL,11,Fboth directions between junction 24 at
OL,12,FKegworth and junction 23A for East
OL,13,FMidlands Airport, later changing on the
OL,14,Fsouthbound side to affect junctions 23A
OL,15,Fand 23.
OL,17,FThe lorry was recovered from the scene
OL,18,Ffollowing a "complex" operation which
OL,19,Ftook place throughout the morning.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
