OL,3,GNEWSAM1 reopens after lorry overturned
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe highways agency said residual
OL,6,Fdelays were still affecting the roads
OL,7,Fwith an hour delay on the M1
OL,8,Fsouthbound, 40 minutes on the
OL,9,Fnorthbound side and hour-long delays on
OL,10,Fthe A42 northbound.
